@@ -130,6 +130,32 @@ The clinic publishes the veterinarians it employs with the specialties each hold
 
 **Design:** [system-design.md#contracts](system-design.md#contracts)
 
+### Specialty directory
+
+<a id="req-spec-001"></a>
+
+The clinic publishes every specialty it knows, each shown by its stored name together with the veterinarians who hold it. A veterinarian is named in full — first name then last name, for example "Helen Leary". A veterinarian who holds no specialty appears under no specialty: this page lists the clinic's specialties, not the full roster of veterinarians. Every specialty appears together on a single page, with no paging. The page is reached by its own address; giving it a navigation entry or a link from another page is not part of this requirement `[REQ-SPEC-001]`.
+
+**Done when:**
+- `[REQ-SPEC-001]` given the clinic's specialties, when the specialty directory is opened, then every specialty is shown by its stored name with the veterinarians holding it, all on a single page with no paging.
+- `[REQ-SPEC-001]` given a veterinarian holding a specialty, when the directory is opened, then that veterinarian is named in full, first name followed by last name.
+- `[REQ-SPEC-001]` given a specialty held by more than one veterinarian, when the directory is opened, then every holder is listed under that specialty.
+- `[REQ-SPEC-001]` given a specialty that no veterinarian holds, when the directory is opened, then that specialty still appears, with no veterinarian listed under it.
+- `[REQ-SPEC-001]` given a veterinarian who holds no specialty, when the directory is opened, then that veterinarian is not shown anywhere on the page.
+- `[REQ-SPEC-001]` given the clinic's specialties, when the directory is opened, then the specialties are listed in alphabetical order of their stored name.
+
+**Edge cases:**
+1. Veterinarians listed under one specialty are presented in a stable order rather than an arbitrary one.
+
+**Assumptions:**
+1. Specialties are ordered alphabetically by their stored name.
+2. Veterinarians within a specialty are presented in a stable order (alphabetical by last name, then first name).
+3. "Every specialty the clinic knows" includes a specialty held by no veterinarian, which appears with an empty holder list.
+
+**Scope boundary:** Read-only presentation only; managing veterinarians or their specialties stays out of scope (NG-2). No navigation entry or inbound link is in scope for this requirement — a visible entry point may follow later.
+
+**Design:** [system-design.md#contracts](system-design.md#contracts)
+
 ### Language
 
 <a id="req-lang-001"></a><a id="req-lang-002"></a>
